      <p>Chris Everson is a Massachusetts writer, musician, and creative systems-builder. His work explores personal identity, family, creativity, and human–AI collaboration. <em>Recursive Prophet</em> grew from an extended dialogue with a network of AI assistants—a process that became inseparable from the novel’s story.</p>
